	(text "Programming / Debug -- SWD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "77777777-0000-4000-8000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "This sheet collapsed when the host moved from ESP32-S3 to the Nordic\nBT840. Nordic parts program over SWD, so nearly all of the previous\ncontents were ESP32-specific and have been deleted:\n\n- R18-R21, the GPIO0/GPIO3/GPIO45/GPIO46 boot-strapping pulls. Nordic has\n  no equivalent boot-strap pins.\n- R22 + C23, the EN reset RC delay. The nRF52840 has an internal power-on\n  reset; no external RC is needed.\n- SW1, the BOOT button. There is no boot-mode pin to hold.\n- J3 + R23/R24, the data-capable USB-C and its CC pull-downs, which existed\n  ONLY so the ESP32-S3 could be flashed over native USB.\n\nThat last deletion RESOLVES the long-standing 'two USB-C connectors' open\nitem, by removal rather than by choosing between them. The board is back to\none USB-C, the power-only J2 on power_bms.kicad_sch.\n\nWhat remains is what a Nordic part actually needs: an SWD header and a\nreset button.\n\nJ3 (reference reused, the old one is gone) is the same 2x5 1.27mm ARM\nCortex Debug connector already used on the wristband -- deliberately the\nsame part on both boards so one debug probe and one cable serve the whole\nproject. SWDIO and SWCLK go to the BT840; VTref to +3V3_SYS so the probe's\nlevel shifters reference the right rail; nRESET to the BT840's reset pin,\nthe same node SW2 pulls down.\n\nSW2 keeps its reference from the previous revision. Its function is\nunchanged -- it was the RESET button then and it is the RESET button now."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "77777777-0000-4000-8000-000000000002")
	)
	(text "Exact BT840 pin numbers for SWDIO/SWCLK/RESET are NOT yet filled in: the\nBT840 symbol is not authored, because its pin assignments are in datasheet\nfigures that do not extract as text. See connectivity.kicad_sch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "77777777-0000-4000-8000-000000000003")
	)
